id|cell_06
title|The Light and Fear
v_from|49
v_to|70
scenes|scene_08_afghanistan_battle.txt;scene_09_ufo_abduction.txt
beat|Fear fell upon many who beheld it; some fled, others stood frozen, and the soldiers raised their weapons yet no weapon was fired, for all were overcome by confusion. Suddenly the earth shook and a deep, powerful sound filled the air though no source could be seen. Then there descended from the vessel a great beam of blue light, falling upon the place where Lucky, Astra, Kaito, and the weapon stood. Those touched by the light felt their bodies grow weightless; soldiers cried out, merchants fled, crowds scattered in terror. Yet Lucky and Astra could neither run nor resist, for an unseen force held them fast; they began to rise from the ground, and Kaito and certain of his men rose also, and the weapon was lifted with them. Many witnessed these things and trembled, yet none understood what purpose lay behind them.

